{"q":"112","t":"Path Sum","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>root</code> of a binary tree and an integer <code>targetSum</code>, return <code>true</code> if the tree has a <strong>root-to-leaf</strong> path such that adding up all the values along the path equals <code>targetSum</code>.</p>\n\n<p>A <strong>leaf</strong> is a node with no children.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/cd21a255141485c6.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 356px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [5,4,8,11,null,13,4,7,2,null,null,null,1], targetSum = 22\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The root-to-leaf path with the target sum is shown.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/11a5874e76f91445.jpg\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [1,2,3], targetSum = 5\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> There are two root-to-leaf paths in the tree:\n(1 --&gt; 2): The sum is 3.\n(1 --&gt; 3): The sum is 4.\nThere is no root-to-leaf path with sum = 5.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [], targetSum = 0\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Since the tree is empty, there are no root-to-leaf paths.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[0, 5000]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-1000 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n\t<li><code>-1000 &lt;= targetSum &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"hasPathSum\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"root\",\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"targetSum\",\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Breadth-First Search","slug":"breadth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"}],"s":[{"t":"Path Sum II","s":"path-sum-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Binary Tree Maximum Path Sum","s":"binary-tree-maximum-path-sum","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Sum Root to Leaf Numbers","s":"sum-root-to-leaf-numbers","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Path Sum III","s":"path-sum-iii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Path Sum IV","s":"path-sum-iv","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Apple","apple"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[],"m":[["Amazon","amazon",13],["Google","google",12],["Meta","facebook",9],["Microsoft","microsoft",9],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",7],["Apple","apple",4],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",3],["TikTok","tiktok",2],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks",2]]}}